<title>HUNGARY: Hungary prelim May ind output up 1.7 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Hungary prelim May ind output up 1.7 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's industrial output rose 1.7 percent in May in year-on-year terms and fell 1.7 percent from April, according to seasonally adjusted preliminary figures, the Central Statistical Office (KSH) said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>    HUNGARY INDUSTRY OUTPUT	May 97     April 97     May 96</p>
<p>    Monthly change (pct)	   -1.7	  +9.0	  +7.3</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change (pct)    +1.7	 +11.4	  -3.6</p>
<p>NOTE - The figures are seasonally adjusted. May 1997 figures are preliminary. The statistical office said it planned to publish final, detailed May figures on July 14.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
